      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, \"sexual agitation\" and \"application rate\"? i think you might have glitched out there for a second lol. i meant looking for physical defects in the wood itself. like, what kind of knots or grain issues should i be worried about that might compromise the structural integrity of the Douglas Fir?",
